    "explanation": "<p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground\">Simplifying algebraic fractions involves <strong>cancelling</strong> common factors from the numerator and denominator, similar to simplifying numerical fractions. This helps write the fraction in its simplest form.</p>",
